  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Dragon Ball Xenoverse 2 - Legendary Pack Set",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/10440/450x258/dragon-ball-xenoverse-2-legendary-pack-set-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787878800",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/10440-buy-dragon-ball-xenoverse-2-legendary-pack-set-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "Dragonbearwizard",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "i received the key and redeemed it without problems,\n\nIn terms of the content of this DLC, it's pretty expensive for what you get, i don't really like any of the characters, and i still don't know how to use some of the super moves they have, even at max ki i can't use topo's super move, some of the characters also have default moves alongside unique ones, like a masenko or some other move that's already in the game."
    },
    {
      "game": "Sid Meier’s Civilization VII",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/17463/450x258/sid-meier-s-civilization-vii-pc-mac-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787878800",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/17463-buy-sid-meier-s-civilization-vii-pc-mac-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-9b3e6ff",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "6/10 \n\n\n\nI'm trying really hard to love it and give it a chance.\n\n\n\nEven beyond the well documented philosophical changes to the gameplay the graphics and UI are, despite being very detailed, kind of difficult to intuitively grasp. Going from Civ 4 to Civ 5 I never needed the tutorials. Going from Civ 5 to 6 I didn't bother with them except for game mechanics. With Civ 7 it's just hard to tell what is actually happening at first and then the whole \"World as HEX\" conceit is weird and dark and almost sterile in its approach. I liked Civ 5's faux \"realism\" and I appreciated Civ 6's \"cartoony\" approach ... this is just a weird layout and style on top of all the other structural changes."
    },
    {
      "game": "Manor Lords",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/8253/450x258/manor-lords-pc-game-steam-europe-cover.jpg?v=1787878800",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/8253-buy-manor-lords-pc-game-steam-europe/",
      "user": "gamer-6afdbdc",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "just love the game overall it's 8/10 for me, it's super satisfying to see your village build up and grow.\n\n\n\nonly cons for me is the slow development what i mean by that is often in mid game im just waiting month's month's for villager to join my village cause it's 1 family per month (not that big of a deal cause it's nice to contemplate and think about what next for your village) but it could be cool to gain maybe +2 familly depending on overall happiness and need granted.\n\n\n\nsaw couple ppl complains about the update release schedule, i personally dont have an issue with that it's a small team and i like that they focus on bug fixing first and quality updates."
    },
    {
      "game": "BlazBlue: Centralfiction",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/3828/450x258/blazblue-centralfiction-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787878800",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/3828-buy-blazblue-centralfiction-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "1MantisPhoenix",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "\"Dammit, that huge boob woman's coming...\"\n\n\"It's not that she wanted those two humps... She was born with them! Completely out of her control. And a ponytail tied at exactly the right height to accentuate her stylish figure. Yes... Pure and mainstream!\"\n\n\n\nIt's an epic fighting game, filled with tonnes of content and great art, great moves, it's very deep for a 4-button fighter.\n\nThe cast of fighters is gigantic, and you unlock some new fighters by finishing the story. It's a very long story too!\""
    }
